          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "04. What is the difference between all the hair oils?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Holiroots Hair Oil is a prewash root treatment oil for stronger, healthier hair, and has a black dropper lid. Amla Soothing Serum is a prewash lightweight pre-wash serum to soothe and hydrate sensitive, itchy scalps. Smooth & Shine Hair Oil is a post-wash hair elixir to smooth, tame, protect and shine and has a white dropper lid.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
