            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>At Fable & Mane, we pride ourselves on using only the highest quality ingredients in our products. As a result, each batch may vary slightly in color, scent, and texture, without compromising on efficacy. While we strive for consistency and quality in every product we make, we also believe that the natural variations in our formulations make each one truly special and unique. We also recognize that scent is a highly personal experience, and that everyone’s sense of smell is unique. Therefore, we cannot guarantee that every customer will experience the same scent or note from our products.<br/><br/></p>",
